## Not included here

The two entries in `.gitmodules` (`tools/Gadgetbridge`, `tools/Gadgetbridge-tools`, both AGPL-3.0)
are submodule references, not copies: git stores only a URL and a commit id, and their files are
fetched from their own projects. No code from either is present in this repository or in anything
built from it. `docs/PROTOCOL.md` cites their findings the way it cites any other source.

Likewise `apk/` (the vendor application and its decompiled output) and `tools/android-sdk/` are
git-ignored and are not distributed here.
